	<style>
		#advSearchControls .contentDropdown {
			color: #555;
		}

		#advSearchControls .contentDropdown .checkbox input::before,
		#advSearchControlsP.blueBG .contentDropdown .checkbox input::before {
			color: #555;
		}

		#advSearchControls .contentDropdown .tipTitle {
			padding-left: 0;
			color: #AAA;
		}

		#advSearchControls .contentDropdown .tooltipstered {
			display: none;
		}

		#advSearchControls .contentDropdown {
			padding: 11px 10px 5px 10px;
			border: 1px solid #aeaeae;
		}

		#advSearchControls .contentDropdown>.title:after {
			top: 12px;
			color: #AAA;
		}
		@media (min-width: 992px) {
			#advSearchControls .advSubmit, #advSearchControlsP .advSubmit {
				text-align: right;
				margin-top: -45px;
			}

		}

	</style>

	<section id="homeHero" style="background-image:url(/assets/components/phpthumbof/cache/home_hero_bg.9963cdeb490026fcfdf8f5c97ca1c2f3.jpg);">
		<div class="overlay">
			<div class="magGlass"></div>
			<div class="container">
				<div class="content text-center">
					<h1>The history of Europe - one click away</h1>
					
					<p>Archives Portal Europe provides you with a single access to find, browse and discover information on archives about Europe held by thousands of cultural heritage institutions from more than 30 countries. We continually grow and expand our content, adding more countries, more institutions, and more archival collections.</p>
				</div>
				<div id="searchContainer">
					<div class="content text-center">
						<div class="tipTitle">
							<div class="tipIcon" data-tooltip-content="#searchMainTooltip">
								<i class="far fa-question-circle"></i>
							</div>
							<h4>Start your search</h4>
						</div>
						<p>Type in your keywords and discover over 650,000 archival collections including hundreds of millions of documents, the persons and organisations that created and used these documents, and the institutions holding the archival material today.</p>
					</div>
					<form class="search large" action="https://www.archivesportaleurope.net/" method="post">
						<input type="text" autocomplete="off" data-input="search_term" class="searchField" name="search"
							placeholder="Type search term..."
							value="">
						<input type="submit" data-control="search_term_trigger" data-switch-to="archive">
						<div class="suggestions" data-interface="suggestions">

							<div class="suggest_inner" data-container="section_suggest" style="display: none;">
								<h5>Sections</h5>
								<div data-populate="section_suggest"></div>
								<hr>
							</div>

							<div class="suggest_inner" data-container="spelling_suggest" style="display: none;">
								<h5>Spelling</h5>
								<div data-populate="spelling_suggest"></div>
								<hr>
							</div>

							<div class="suggest_inner" data-container="topic_suggest" style="display: none;">
								<h5>Topics</h5>
								<div data-populate="topic_suggest"></div>
								<hr>
							</div>


							


						</div>
						<span class="clearSearch">Clear search term</span>
						<div class="tools clearfix">
							<a class="expandAdv"><span>Show</span> advanced search options <i
									class="fas fa-angle-down"></i></a>
							<div class="checkboxes" data-control="checkbox_filters">
								<span class="checkbox">
									<input data-type="homepage_filter" data-filter-field="containsdigital" data-filter-value="true"
										data-filter-type="boolean" type="checkbox" name="Contains digital objects">
									<span class="tipText">
										Show only materials with digital objects
										<div class="tipIcon" data-tooltip-content="#searchDigitalTooltip">
											<i class="far fa-question-circle"></i>
										</div>
									</span>
								</span>
								<span class="checkbox">
									<input data-type="homepage_filter" data-filter-field="separate" data-filter-value="true" data-filter-type="boolean"
										type="checkbox" name="separate">
									<span class="tipText">
										Search each term separately
										<div class="tipIcon" data-tooltip-content="#searchTermTooltip">
											<i class="far fa-question-circle"></i>
										</div>
									</span>
								</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div id="advSearchControls">
							<p class="bold">These advanced options will focus on results from "Search in archives".</p>
							<div class="row">
								<div class="col-sm-6 col-md-3">
									<div class="advControl">
										<div class="tipTitle">
											<div class="tipIcon" data-tooltip-content="#searchElementTooltip">
												<i class="far fa-question-circle"></i>
											</div>
											<p class="strongLabel">Search using</p>
										</div>
										<div class="contentDropdown select-topics" data-g="search-select-topics">
											<div class="title">
												<div class="tipTitle">
													<div class="tipIcon tooltipstered"
														data-tooltip-content="#searchFilterusingTooltip">
														<i class="far fa-question-circle"></i>
													</div>
													Search using
												</div>
											</div>
											<div class="inner" data-facet-set="using" style="display: none;">
												
												<div class="checkboxList" data-control="using">
													
												</div>
											</div>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="col-sm-6 col-md-3">
									<div class="advControl">
										<div class="tipTitle">
											<div class="tipIcon" data-tooltip-content="#searchDocumentTooltip">
												<i class="far fa-question-circle"></i>
											</div>
											<p class="strongLabel">Find document type</p>
										</div>

										<div class="contentDropdown">
											<div class="title">
												<div class="tipTitle">
													<div class="tipIcon tooltipstered"
														data-tooltip-content="#searchFiltertypesTooltip">
														<i class="far fa-question-circle"></i>
													</div>
													Document Type
												</div>
											</div>
											<div class="inner">
												<div class="checkboxList" data-control="types">
													
												</div>
											</div>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 hidden">
									<div class="advControl">
										<div class="tipTitle">
											<div class="tipIcon" data-tooltip-content="#searchDateTooltip">
												<i class="far fa-question-circle"></i>
											</div>
											<p class="strongLabel">Date search</p>
										</div>
										<div class="dateSearch">
											<span class="checkbox">
												<input type="checkbox" name="exactDate" value="1">
												Exact date search
											</span>
											<div class="inputWrapper">
												<i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i>
												<input type="text" id="dateFrom" name="dateFrom" data-input-type="homepage_date_from"
													placeholder="DD-MM-YYYY">
											</div>
											<span class="to">to</span>
											<div class="inputWrapper">
												<i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i>
												<input type="text" id="dateTo" name="dateTo" data-input-type="homepage_date_to"
													placeholder="DD-MM-YYYY">
											</div>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="advSubmit">
								
								<a class="button large pink submitSearch1" data-control="search_term_trigger" data-switch-to="archive"><i class="fas fa-search"></i>
									Search</a>
								<a class="hideAdv">Hide advanced search options <i
										class="fas fa-angle-up"></i></a>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="mobileSubmit">
							<a class="button large pink submitSearch2" data-control="search_term_trigger"
								data-switch-to="archive"><i class="fas fa-search"></i> Search</a>
							<span class="reduceSearch"><i class="fas fa-eye-slash"></i> Reduce search</span>
						</div>
					</form>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="halfTopMargin">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="content text-center">
			<h4 class="superTitle">Not sure what to search?</h4>
			<h2><strong>Explore</strong> our highlights and topics</h2>
		</div>
		<ul class="nav-tabs buttons mt30">
			<li class="active"><a href="#tabDocuments" data-toggle="tab">Features</a></li>
			<li><a href="#tabTopics" data-toggle="tab">Topics</a></li>
		</ul>
		<div class="tab-content">
			<div id="tabDocuments" class="tab-pane fade active in">
				<div class="content text-center">
					<p>Explore the treasures of European culture and dive into special stories behind the scenes, with these highlights from our partner institutions' most precious collections. </p>
				</div>
				<div id="homeDocumentsSlider" class="linkBlockSlider">
					<div class="slide">
						<a class="linkBlock" href="https://www.archivesportaleurope.net/explore/highlights/toys-in-the-archives/">
						    <span class="type pink"><i class="fas fa-file"></i></span>
						    <div class="imageContainer">
							    <div class="image short" style="background-image:url(/assets/components/phpthumbof/cache/Screenshot%202026-10-19%20at%2012.32.33.2e1e365a3ceacc3c98be8c4f535aed91.c2750f27cf624b07477c83bcecd5f477.jpg);"></div>
							</div>
						    <div class="details">
							    <h5>Toys in the Archives</h5>
							    <p>Playing is one of the most important human activities, and we searched for how toys and games are represented in the archives</p>
							    <span class="date">
							        
							        <i class="far fa-calendar-alt mr"></i> 19-10-2026
							        
			                    </span>
						    </div>
						</a>
					</div>
<div class="slide">
						<a class="linkBlock" href="https://www.archivesportaleurope.net/explore/highlights/the-genoa-g8,-25-years-later/">
						    <span class="type pink"><i class="fas fa-file"></i></span>
						    <div class="imageContainer">
							    <div class="image short" style="background-image:url(/assets/components/phpthumbof/cache/Screenshot_2026-07-20_at_13.31.37.a19c132504ed75779c183d6b5fab5cd5.c2750f27cf624b07477c83bcecd5f477.jpg);"></div>
							</div>
						    <div class="details">
							    <h5>The Genoa G8, 25 years later</h5>
							    <p>The infamous 2001 Genoa G8 is now History - here are some of the archival traces in Archives Portal Europe</p>
							    <span class="date">
							        
							        <i class="far fa-calendar-alt mr"></i> 20-07-2026
							        
			                    </span>
						    </div>
						</a>
					</div>
<div class="slide">
						<a class="linkBlock" href="https://www.archivesportaleurope.net/explore/highlights/women-farmers-in-the-archives/">
						    <span class="type pink"><i class="fas fa-file"></i></span>
						    <div class="imageContainer">
							    <div class="image short" style="background-image:url(/assets/components/phpthumbof/cache/Screenshot_2026-10-13_at_17.19.43.2cfe40b090902d0b38c52603a72931d3.c2750f27cf624b07477c83bcecd5f477.jpg);"></div>
							</div>
						    <div class="details">
							    <h5>Women Farmers in the archives</h5>
							    <p>2026 is the International Year of the Woman Farmer, and we celebrate the archival traces of the women who fed humanity </p>
							    <span class="date">
							        
							        <i class="far fa-calendar-alt mr"></i> 16-06-2026
							        
			                    </span>
						    </div>
						</a>
					</div>
<div class="slide">
						<a class="linkBlock" href="https://www.archivesportaleurope.net/explore/highlights/world-cup-in-the-archives/">
						    <span class="type pink"><i class="fas fa-file"></i></span>
						    <div class="imageContainer">
							    <div class="image short" style="background-image:url(/assets/components/phpthumbof/cache/Screenshot_2026-10-16_at_15.18.09.5f33cb14c728d371ee3ae2509f2e54cd.c2750f27cf624b07477c83bcecd5f477.jpg);"></div>
							</div>
						    <div class="details">
							    <h5>World Cup in the archives</h5>
							    <p>We celebrate the 2026 FIFA world cup by diving in the archives searching for the essential: footballs, gloves, goalposts, and 22 players! </p>
							    <span class="date">
							        
							        <i class="far fa-calendar-alt mr"></i> 11-06-2026
							        
			                    </span>
						    </div>
						</a>
					</div>
<div class="slide">
						<a class="linkBlock" href="https://www.archivesportaleurope.net/explore/highlights/thefts-in-the-archives/">
						    <span class="type pink"><i class="fas fa-file"></i></span>
						    <div class="imageContainer">
							    <div class="image short" style="background-image:url(/assets/components/phpthumbof/cache/Screenshot%202026-04-27%20at%2013.25.09.abda7e69ab0c7b94f12a74757ee69bf3.c2750f27cf624b07477c83bcecd5f477.jpg);"></div>
							</div>
						    <div class="details">
							    <h5>Thefts in the Archives</h5>
							    <p>Thefts in the Archives explores the most famous cases of thefts in the archives, whether documents about theft and thieves, or thefts occurred in archives - this to keep the attention up on stolen patrimony from cultural heritage institutions</p>
							    <span class="date">
							        
							        <i class="far fa-calendar-alt mr"></i> 26-01-2026
							        
			                    </span>
						    </div>
						</a>
					</div>
<div class="slide">
						<a class="linkBlock" href="https://www.archivesportaleurope.net/explore/highlights/arts-in-archives-portal-europe/">
						    <span class="type pink"><i class="fas fa-file"></i></span>
