							    <p>#ArtsinAPE celebrates all the music, literature, movies, and visual arts in our archives!</p>
							    <span class="date">
							        
							        <i class="far fa-calendar-alt mr"></i> 12-01-2026
							        
			                    </span>
						    </div>
						</a>
