	<section class="standard alternatingContent">
		<div class="container">
			
			
        
	    <div class="row">
			<div class="col-md-6">
				<div class="vCentre mobileNL last">
					<div class="inner">
						<div class="content">
							<h2>Do you know our <strong>research tools</strong>?<strong></strong></h2><p>Archival research is always complex, and Archives Portal Europe allows you to find new ways to search into archives. Thanks to the Portal you can search through institutions based in different countries, and in different languages, at the same time. We can help you find an approach specifically designed for your needs, no matter what period, topic, dataset, or collection you are looking for. Get the most out of Archives Portal Europe with our research tools.<br></p>
							
							    <a class="button blue" href="https://www.archivesportaleurope.net/tools/research-tools/">View our research tools</a>
							
							
							     
							
						</div>
					</div>
				</div> 
			</div>
		    <div class="col-md-6">
			    <div class="vCentre last">
					<div class="inner">
						<img class="img-responsive" src="/assets/components/phpthumbof/cache/Asset%202.ea8550da985bf62cb5ad8ce578c8478a.jpg">
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>



		</div>
	</section>
	

	

	<section class="pink">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="content text-center">
				<h2><strong>Join</strong> Archives Portal Europe</h2><p>Archives Portal Europe is a worldwide network of researchers, archivists, records managers and more. There are many ways to join and to contribute - whether as an institution looking to share its content online, as a professional archivist or history researcher, or as someone with a love for cultural heritage, read more on what’s in for you </p><p><strong>Join as:</strong></p>
			</div>
			<div class="centreButtons">
				<a class="button blue border" href="https://www.archivesportaleurope.net/about-us/join-us/?tab=registered-user">Registered user</a><a class="button blue border" href="https://www.archivesportaleurope.net/about-us/join-us/?tab=content-provider">Content Provider</a><a class="button blue border" href="https://www.archivesportaleurope.net/about-us/join-us/?tab=country-manager">Country Manager</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

