	<section class="standard alternatingContent reducedTopSM">
		<div class="container">
			
			
        
	    <div class="row">
			<div class="col-md-6">
				<div class="vCentre mobileNL last">
					<div class="inner">
						<div class="content">
							<h2>Learn more <strong>about us</strong></h2><p>We are a passionate international team working closely to create a single entry point to all archives in and about Europe. Colleagues from more than 30 countries collaborate to integrate centuries of cultural heritage and to create new opportunities for historical research and heritage curation in a digital environment. Previously users had to visit various archival websites for their research, but Archives Portal Europe enables them to find information more efficiently from millions of archival materials stored in hundreds of institutions. This is the first time European archives have collaborated on this scale, and the potential that these connections provide is enormous for both archival professionals and the users.</p>
							
							    <a class="button blue" href="https://www.archivesportaleurope.net/about-us/">About us</a>
							
							
							    <a class="button blue" href="https://www.archivesportaleurope.net/tools/">Our tools</a>
							
						</div>
					</div>
				</div> 
			</div>
		    <div class="col-md-6">
			    <div class="vCentre last">
					<div class="inner">
						<img class="img-responsive" src="/assets/components/phpthumbof/cache/7b32e7a2-6070-47f6-8718-10a2aee5a2c1.37c5020c9ec547dcfaac3324b0df0dc8.jpg">
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>



		</div>
	</section>
	

